  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reducing Risks of Floods, Drought, and Biodiversity disruption in Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The workplan aim to strengthen information, preparedness, and institutional capacities in Nigeria to reduce the risks and impacts of floods, drought, and biodiversity disruption, with focus on high-risk states and frontline communities.

